WEBVTT

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.570
Sa... yu... cha... so!

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.800
Let's go out on a high note, 'kay?

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.890
Okay, got it. Got it. But, Asami...

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:25.980
You're hurting me.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:30.170
Sorry! I got a little hyper.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:31.920
Thanks.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.630
Seriously, take good care of her, Yoshida-cchi!

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:40.100
Now, off you go.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:46.660
Yeah. Off I go!

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:26.660
"Resolve"

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.620
I didn't think you'd come with her.

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:30.880
You even used your vacation days.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:38.490
Part of it is that I'd like to support her, 
so that she can be brave.

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:43.800
But she spent more time at my place 
than any other when she was away.

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:48.100
So I think I have a duty 
to explain to her family.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:50.840
To tell you the truth,

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:56.190
it's difficult to tell whether our mother 
will believe your explanation.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.520
But given Sayu's mental state, 
it's a big help.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.610
Yoshida-san?

00:03:02.840 --> 00:03:04.360
You're awake?

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:08.120
You're really coming with me?

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:15.320
Well, the plane's already in the air.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:19.100
Once we get there, 
we'll have a bit of a drive.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:22.350
If you want, 
you can turn back at the airport.

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:24.110
No, no. That's not right!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.470
I'll go! Please let me go.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:30.940
Stop laughing, Sayu.

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:36.190
I told you I'd watch out for you 
until the end, right?

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:37.610
Yeah.

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:45.740
You know, these seats are really comfy.

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:48.870
Right? They're great.

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:52.750
You don't spend a lot of time 
in business class?

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:55.710
I've never been on a plane before, actually!

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.240
Really?

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.960
I thought you would've taken one 
on a trip or something.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.180
Our family doesn't really do trips.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.870
So it's kind of fun.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:13.080
I know that this is a weird time 
to say that, but...

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.810
No, I get it.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:18.300
I'm an adult, and I still get excited 
when I'm in business class.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.300
Right?

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.030
Look, look, Yoshida-san!

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.870
You can see the shadow of the plane 
on the clouds!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.720
So that's how it looks from up here!

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:33.290
Wow!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:48.700
Thank you.

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:52.600
We'll head to Sapporo by car.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.200
Um, Sapporo...?

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.860
Don't you live in Asahikawa?

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.260
There's a branch of my company there.

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:03.450
I want to drop in quickly.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.080
I see.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:10.500
I can't leave Tokyo 
without a reason, either, you see.

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.840
I'm sorry.

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:14.290
Oh, it's fine...

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:20.700
Can you guys kill some time by yourselves?

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.420
Two or three hours will do.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.630
Okay, got it.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.780
Let me know 
when you're ready to order.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:49.200
I didn't know cafés could be so fancy!

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.160
They're not all like this.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.870
I've never been in one this fancy myself.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.330
Really?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.330
Do I look like a guy 
who spends time in fancy cafés?

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:05.680
No, now that you mention it.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:10.510
But I thought everybody went to cafés.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.460
What about you?

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:13.910
Me?

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.810
I've never really been to one.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:18.860
I see.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.360
Wow, there's a lot of stuff here.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:24.730
What do you want, Yoshida-san?

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:27.870
Coffee.

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.660
Iced? Hot?

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.230
Hot, I guess.

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:32.990
Since we're in a fancy café.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.240
What's that got to do with it?

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.960
I'll have this, then.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:40.040
Green tea au lait?

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.630
Yeah, I want something sweet, 
since we're in a fancy café.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.330
Excuse me!

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:53.880
Coming.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.780
Have you decided on your order?

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:59.740
A hot coffee and a green tea au lait.

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:01.160
All right.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:18.430
They seem to be having fun.

00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:20.860
About what we were talking about...

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:26.120
If I didn't go right home after school, 
Mom would get mad.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:29.660
And she wouldn't let me 
out of the house most weekends.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:32.680
I never even thought about going to a café.

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.920
When I ran away from home 
and was wandering around town,

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:42.140
I saw all the girls my age going in groups 
into cafés, like it was totally normal.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:48.810
And I realized that it was a
normal thing for teenagers to do.

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:57.280
So I'm kind of happy I got to go to a café 
with you for no real reason!

00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.680
I see.

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:02.500
Glad to hear it.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:03.690
Yeah.

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:12.050
Hey, aren't you scared to go home?

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.760
I am scared.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.850
That's why you came with me.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:25.930
But I knew I had to go home someday.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:31.490
And "someday" is almost here.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.800
Here you go.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:38.010
Hot coffee and green tea au lait!

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.110
Here it is!

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.920
It's sweet and tastes great!

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:55.800
It's good.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:56.840
Really?

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.310
Cafés are great, huh?

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.180
You can drink something delicious 
and just watch time pass slowly by.

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.700
I feel a lot better.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.600
Thanks!

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:14.240
Yeah, they are nice.

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:15.220
Right?

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:23.080
You drive yourself, huh?

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.830
This is a personal errand.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:31.020
Don't worry. I have a gold license.

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.400
Oh, um... sorry.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.420
Thanks.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.850
Sayu, can I head straight home?

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:47.530
There's a place I want you to go first.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.270
Where?

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:53.210
School.

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:03.140
<b>Asahikawa 6th High School</b>

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:18.090
I'll be right back.

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:20.340
You're going inside?

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.010
Yeah, there's somewhere I want to go.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:28.460
Don't do anything dangerous, okay?

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.360
I want Yoshida-san to come with me.

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.290
Me?

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:41.130
I'm a little scared to go myself.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:44.240
H-Hey!

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:46.700
Don't be in such a hurry!

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.670
Fine, fine. Stop pulling me.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.250
We're not going through the front gate?

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:59.390
This place doesn't really have any security.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.480
But there are cameras around the front gate.

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:03.760
Yeah?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:08.880
Nobody would sneak in,
even if there weren't cameras.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.980
We're sneaking in right now.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.380
But we're not doing anything bad.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:25.410
Good. It's not fixed yet.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.810
The door up ahead has a busted lock.

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:31.620
So you can get inside easily.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.460
Hurry up, Yoshida-san.

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:46.480
This is definitely trespassing, isn't it?

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.850
I guess so.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:53.810
You guess? You might be fine, 
but if I get caught, I'm in trouble.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:57.880
Nobody would go to a school 
in the countryside at this hour.

00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:01.280
And you've already done something 
way sketchier.

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:04.650
I guess you've got me there.

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:12.910
Hurry!

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.900
This is totally trespassing.

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:25.160
<b>Fire extinguisher</b>

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:30.760
It's kind of creepy, huh?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.810
Yeah.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.380
Hey!

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.140
Up higher?

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:57.610
Yeah.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.320
Hey, is the place you wanted to go...?

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:02.550
The roof.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:06.510
I see.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.320
We're here.

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:04.040
Sayu!

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:11.120
<i>This... This is the place 
that changed Sayu's life.</i>

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.330
Yoshida-san, please...

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.990
Sayu, are you okay?

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:35.530
Yeah...

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.410
Hey! Are you okay?

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.420
Take it easy if you need to.

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.180
I'm fine.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.010
Sayu...

00:15:20.010 --> 00:15:21.220
I'm fine!

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:24.520
I'm fine.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:32.440
This is where it all ended, 
and where it all began.

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:40.540
Hey!

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:45.110
If...! If only...

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.960
this fence were here sooner...

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:55.480
It's my fault Yuuko died.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:59.400
I couldn't understand 
how she was feeling.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:04.230
I thought the right thing to do was fight. 
But I was wrong.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:08.890
I'm the one who pushed her over the edge.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:10.490
Sayu.

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:12.490
If only I'd—

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:13.240
Sayu!

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:17.660
It's not your—

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.170
It's not your fault!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:29.460
That's...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.220
That's not true!

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:37.210
I just pretended to care about her!

00:16:37.210 --> 00:16:39.810
But I didn't see what
was really going on with her!

00:16:40.160 --> 00:16:45.240
If it weren't for the bullying, 
you both would've been fine!

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:49.450
And I was the cause of it!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.620
But even so...

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:53.820
It was her decision to approach you!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:57.780
She admired you! 
She wanted to be your friend!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:00.520
But that's why...

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:07.710
Sayu... You were both
each other's only friend!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.090
You cared about each other.

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.410
But you just cared too much!

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:16.200
If she cared about me,

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.250
then...

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:21.780
I wanted her to live!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.390
But if I say that,

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:33.990
it makes it sound like 
I'm saying it's Yuuko's fault!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:36.150
That's fine.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.530
It's not!

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.870
It is!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:42.300
Something went wrong! 
You couldn't fix it!

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.590
And it ended up really bad!

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.660
But even so— Even so...

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:50.840
It's all in the past now.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:18:01.630
If you can't forgive yourself, 
you'll be stuck on this roof forever!

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.660
It's okay now, Sayu.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.920
She told you to smile, right?

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.700
Sayu...

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:44.640
Yoshida-san.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:49.640
I'm really glad you came with me.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:53.360
If I were alone, 
I don't know if I could bear it.

00:18:53.890 --> 00:18:57.290
I'm glad I came with you, then.

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:28.140
I'll see you again some time, Yuuko.

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:36.880
I'll buy you a new handkerchief, Yoshida-san.

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.740
It's fine. Forget it.

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:42.200
Are you okay now?

00:19:45.960 --> 00:19:46.910
Not at all.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:50.060
Yeah, of course.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:51.120
But...

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:11.220
I'm ready to face it.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.560
I'm going to remember her a lot.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:20.140
Until some day I can think of her and smile.

00:20:21.390 --> 00:20:22.620
I see.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:36.080
I hope that day comes soon.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.740
Yeah.

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:55.140
Can we head home?

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:57.610
Yes. Please.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.320
<b>Ogiwara</b>

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.310
<i>I'm home.</i>

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:17.850
<i>Back to the place I spent 
over half a year running from...</i>

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:27.780
<i>Because Yoshida-san was there for me,</i>

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:30.280
<i>I was able to work up the courage.</i>

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:36.140
I'm back, Mom.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.260
<i>So...</i>

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:42.480
<i>I need to end this.</i>

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:44.570
Mom, I brought Sayu.

00:21:47.450 --> 00:21:48.580
Sayu!

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:35.010
"Mother"

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>I'll watch this episode again and again, 
until some day I can think about next week and smile.</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>See you next week!</b>
